{"obsah":"<p>Individual coaching and then straight to the Bublava charity ball, which aims to raise money from local businesses for the development of the village. After a series of performances by well-known artists, things needed livening up, so organiser Vláďa Keblůžek remembered Vlasta, who set off with Michal Budský to ride the local dance floor. It turned out to be the biggest obstacle, because it was really extra slippery. </p>\n\n<p>Unfortunately the high jump was won by a guy from Prague who didn't like our classic joke about Praguers (even though Michal is from Prague too) and jumped highest over the tape. Thanks for the invitation and to everyone who came for your support.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-03-24-at-10.48.18.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-03-24-at-10.48.18.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250510\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-03-24-at-10.48.26-1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-03-24-at-10.48.26-1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250512\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FWhatsApp-Image-2025-03-24-at-10.48.26-2.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-w